BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:chania-meskla-kreatotourta-meat-pie-festival-for-the-dormition-mesk-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Kreatotourta (meat pie) festival for the Dormition\, Meskla
LOCATION:Meskla\, Crete (Chania)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the eve of the Dormition the village at the foot of the White Mountains bakes its kreatotourta\, the Chania meat-and-cheese pie\, and serves it with music in the square (Nikos Pontikakis played 2026). It is one of a dozen panigiria in Kydonia that night\, so it is not overrun. The road up from Fournes is narrow\; leave the car below the church.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#meskla-kreatotourta-meat-pie-festival-for-the-dormition-mesk
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#meskla-kreatotourta-meat-pie-festival-for-the-dormition-mesk
END:VEVENT
