BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:chania-fres-panigiri-of-the-dormition-fres-and-litsarda-apokoronas-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition\, Fres and Litsarda (Apokoronas)
LOCATION:Fres\, Crete (Chania)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Apokoronas plateau is the densest panigiri zone in Chania on 14–15 August: Fres\, Litsarda\, Pemonia\, Alikampos and Kefalas all hold two-night feasts with lyra-and-laouto kompanies (Pantermakis\, Karkanis\, Kontaros\, Pontikakis in 2026). Villages are a few minutes apart\, so people move between squares\; dancing goes on until dawn. Book a taverna table or bring cash for the syllogos food stall.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#fres-panigiri-of-the-dormition-fres-and-litsarda-apokoronas
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#fres-panigiri-of-the-dormition-fres-and-litsarda-apokoronas
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:chania-fres-panigiri-of-the-dormition-fres-and-litsarda-apokoronas-2028@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition\, Fres and Litsarda (Apokoronas)
LOCATION:Fres\, Crete (Chania)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Apokoronas plateau is the densest panigiri zone in Chania on 14–15 August: Fres\, Litsarda\, Pemonia\, Alikampos and Kefalas all hold two-night feasts with lyra-and-laouto kompanies (Pantermakis\, Karkanis\, Kontaros\, Pontikakis in 2026). Villages are a few minutes apart\, so people move between squares\; dancing goes on until dawn. Book a taverna table or bring cash for the syllogos food stall.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#fres-panigiri-of-the-dormition-fres-and-litsarda-apokoronas
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#fres-panigiri-of-the-dormition-fres-and-litsarda-apokoronas
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:chania-anopoli-graviera-festival-anopoli-sfakion-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Graviera Festival\, Anopoli Sfakion
LOCATION:Anopoli\, Crete (Chania)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the evening of 15 August the Anopoli cultural association and the Municipality of Sfakia lay a communal table on the plateau above Chora Sfakion: boiled meat with pilafi\, Sfakian stew\, graviera\, honey and wine\, with a Cretan kompania and the local dance society. It has run since the mid-1980s and draws people from all over Crete. Start is around 9 pm\; drive up the hairpins from Chora Sfakion in daylight and park on the plateau road.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#anopoli-graviera-festival-anopoli-sfakion
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#anopoli-graviera-festival-anopoli-sfakion
END:VEVENT
